{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-01237-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["미 국무부는 한·미 장관회담 결과자료에서 “대북 문제에 있어 한국과 긴밀한 공조를 재확인했다”","재무부는 트위터를 통해서도"],"reason":"The sanctions and Moon's remarks are accurate. The summary wrongly attributes the 한·미 장관회담 result statement to the Treasury Department, when the source attributes it to the State Department, and then repeats the sentence. It also omits the timing controversy and the interpretation as a possible warning."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["발표 전날 문재인 대통령이 신년 기자회견을 통해","미묘한 해석을 낳고 있다"],"reason":"It preserves the sanctions, the tweet and the subtle interpretation. It wrongly says Moon's press conference was on the 14th, when the source says it was the day before the announcement, though the source also gives the 14th as its date. The wording is awkward ('해석이 낳고'). It omits the '경고' analysis and the foreign ministers' talks."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["문 대통령은 14일 오전 신년 기자회견을 통해 “대북 제재는 자체가 목표가 아니다”","강 장관은 ... 마이크 폼페이오 장관과 의견을 나눴다"],"reason":"It conflates Moon's remarks with the foreign ministers' talks. Its claim that Moon commented on 대북 제재 완화 and then the ministers talked is a muddled causal link, and Kang Kyung-wha is described only vaguely. It omits the timing and 'warning' interpretation and the differing views among Korea, the US and Japan."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["문 대통령은 7일 신년사에서도 남북 철도ㆍ도로 연결사업과 개성공단· 금강산 관광 재개의 필요성을 언급했다","발표 전날 문재인 대통령이 신년 기자회견"],"reason":"It covers the sanctions and the tweet but only mentions Moon's 7th New Year's address, with the tautological phrase '언급을 언급했다'. It misses the 14th press conference's call for sanctions exemptions and the timing controversy, which are the core of the article."}}}
